Package: folio-chord
Version: 0.1.1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 1000
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0, gir1.2-gst-plugins-base-1.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-libav, python3-mutagen, librsvg2-common
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, gstreamer1.0-pulseaudio | gstreamer1.0-pipewire, wodim, genisoimage, eject, fonts-crosextra-carlito
Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: music player for music, internet radio and podcasts
 Folio Chord is a music player in the manner of the classic iTunes: a library
 of your music folders with the column browser, list, album list and grid
 views, playlists and Smart Playlists, ratings, Get Info, the status display,
 Mini Player, equalizer and visualizer. Internet radio comes from the
 radio-browser.info directory, podcasts from Apple's public podcast directory
 or Podcast Index. Audio CDs can be imported (with track names from
 MusicBrainz) and playlists burned to disc. No account is needed.
